        "cooked": "<p>For those of you who haven't seen it, there was a new show released on Disney XD not too long ago Called Milo Murphy's Law.</p><p>The show's protagonist, Milo Murphy is the great, great, great, great grandson of the original Murphy from “Murphy’s Law”, and, well...</p><p>Here's a link to watch: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OpbUMDCzhEc</p><p>After watching this, I think you all will see why I call Milo 'Young Setback'.</p>",
